     9	  B. extraction's code checks (extraction.sift) over every stored extraction answer
    10	  C. matching's code checks (matching.check) over every stored matching record, with the lists shown at the time
    11	  D. every schema enum value appears verbatim in the prompt that asks for it
    12	
    13	Usage: python3 scripts/preflight.py [--views DB ...]   (defaults: the archive, the window test database, the
    14	current views database and every old-*/views.sqlite under poc/data). Exit status 1 when a check judged no case.
    15	"""
    16	import argparse
    17	import collections
    18	import glob
    19	import json
