     1	"""Assemble the test database from the raw harvests: one row per item with the fields of the classification PRD
     2	(docs/prd/02-classification.md), a class (新闻, 公司材料, 官方材料), a 16-category tag kept as an attribute, the
     3	whole original text, and whether the item is an original the pipeline may read (feed). Re-runnable: it rebuilds
     4	items.sqlite from raw/ every time; items.sqlite is derived, raw/ is the record.
     5	
     6	Rules that matter (Alex 2026-10-23: the material must be original, not processed):
     7	- text is the whole page or document as text (.full.txt), nothing cut; a page without it is not fed.
     8	- a page's publication day is the earlier of the listing's day and the page's own date (the day the market could
     9	  first have seen it, 02-classification 时间规则 5), in New York time.
    10	- a copy points at its original: the same canonical URL, or the same title on the same day when one side is an
    11	  aggregator or both are the same publisher; distinct outlets with the same headline stay distinct.
    12	- feed = 1 only for coverage 'full': an original page or document, not blocked, not a stub, not truncated.
    13	"""
    14	import collections
    15	import datetime
    16	import email.utils
    17	import json
    18	import os
    19	import re
    20	import sqlite3
    21	import sys
    22	import urllib.parse
